{"id":"11e1272c45fe01cc","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-tate-thesis.md","title":"Tate's Thesis","display":"thm-tate-thesis — Tate's Thesis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-tate-thesis","aliases":["58-thm-tate-thesis"],"display":"thm-tate-thesis — Tate's Thesis","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-adelic-zeta]]","[[../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform]]","[[../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zeta-function]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ivc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-tate-thesis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-tate-thesis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tate-thesis — Tate's Thesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9b559d9a72ff847c\" href=\"?note=9b559d9a72ff847c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-adelic-zeta\">../batch09/58-df-adelic-zeta</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c24c7e81186cbc4b\" href=\"?note=c24c7e81186cbc4b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform\">../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fbec6c5b7a044255\" href=\"?note=fbec6c5b7a044255\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space\">../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bd554d3da5a43116\" href=\"?note=bd554d3da5a43116\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zeta-function\">../batch15/58-df-zeta-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"37336284b6cfdfa6\" href=\"?note=37336284b6cfdfa6\" title=\"58-df-ivc\">58-df-ivc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (number field) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb A_K\">\\(\\mathbb A_K\\)</span> (its adele ring)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_K=\\mathbb A_K^\\times/K^\\times\">\\(C_K=\\mathbb A_K^\\times/K^\\times\\)</span> (idele-class group)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{C_K}\">\\(\\tau_{C_K}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times}\\)</span> (the designated topologies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:C_K\\to\\mathbb C^\\times\">\\(\\chi:C_K\\to\\mathbb C^\\times\\)</span> (unitary Hecke character)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)\\)</span> (Schwartz–Bruhat function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d^\\times x\">\\(d^\\times x\\)</span> (multiplicative Haar measure normalized compatibly with a self-dual additive Haar measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumberField}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NumberField}_S\\)</span> (metatheoretic number-field predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"37336284b6cfdfa6\" href=\"?note=37336284b6cfdfa6\" title=\"58-df-ivc\">58-df-ivc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S\\)</span> (meromorphicity predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S\\)</span> (topology-sensitive unitary Hecke-character predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(f,\\chi,s)\">\\(Z(f,\\chi,s)\\)</span> (global Tate zeta integral)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat f\">\\(\\hat f\\)</span> (Fourier transform)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}character}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\n\\land C_K=\\mathbb A_K^\\times/K^\\times\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi,C_K,\\mathbb C^\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\n\\chi,C_K,\\tau_{C_K},\\mathbb C^\\times,\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in C_K\\;\\chi(xy)=\\chi(x)\\chi(y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in C_K\\;|\\chi(x)|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}character}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\n\\land C_K=\\mathbb A_K^\\times/K^\\times\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi,C_K,\\mathbb C^\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\n\\chi,C_K,\\tau_{C_K},\\mathbb C^\\times,\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in C_K\\;\\chi(xy)=\\chi(x)\\chi(y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in C_K\\;|\\chi(x)|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tate\\text{-}thesis\\text{-}integral}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)\n\\to\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\n\\to\nZ(f,\\chi,s)=\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\nf(x)\\chi(x)|x|_{\\mathbb A_K}^{s}\\,d^\\times x\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tate\\text{-}thesis\\text{-}integral}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)\n\\to\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\n\\to\nZ(f,\\chi,s)=\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\nf(x)\\chi(x)|x|_{\\mathbb A_K}^{s}\\,d^\\times x\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tate\\text{-}thesis}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)\n\\to\\exists F,H\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(F,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(H,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\n\\to F(s)=Z(f,\\chi,s)\\land H(s)=Z(\\widehat f,\\chi^{-1},s)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(F(s)=H(1-s)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tate\\text{-}thesis}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)\n\\to\\exists F,H\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(F,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(H,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\n\\to F(s)=Z(f,\\chi,s)\\land H(s)=Z(\\widehat f,\\chi^{-1},s)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(F(s)=H(1-s)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The assertion requires continuity, multiplicativity, and unit modulus; an arbitrary function on the idele-class group is not a Hecke character.</li>\n<li>The domain and codomain topologies are explicit parameters, so continuity is not hidden in the word “character.”</li>\n<li>Tate's thesis obtains analytic continuation and functional equations for degree-one Hecke <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-functions, not for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-functions.</li>\n<li>The number-field, adele, Haar-measure, Fourier-transform, and meromorphic-continuation constructions are used at the explicitly marked metatheoretic boundary; they are not silently treated as set-level primitives.</li>\n<li>The global functional equation follows from Poisson summation; local comparison with standard test functions produces the local gamma and epsilon factors.</li>\n<li>For nontrivial <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> the completed Hecke <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-function is entire; the trivial character is the case with simple poles at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=0\">\\(s=0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=1\">\\(s=1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-adelic-zeta","status":"resolved","id":"9b559d9a72ff847c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-adelic-zeta]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"c24c7e81186cbc4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space","status":"resolved","id":"fbec6c5b7a044255","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zeta-function","status":"resolved","id":"bd554d3da5a43116","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zeta-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ivc","status":"resolved","id":"37336284b6cfdfa6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ivc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ivc","status":"resolved","id":"37336284b6cfdfa6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumberField}_S$ (metatheoretic number-field predicate from [[58-df-ivc]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb A_K","display":false},{"tex":"C_K=\\mathbb A_K^\\times/K^\\times","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{C_K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:C_K\\to\\mathbb C^\\times","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)","display":false},{"tex":"d^\\times x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumberField}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"Z(f,\\chi,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\hat f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unitary\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}character}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumberField}_S(K)\n\\land C_K=\\mathbb A_K^\\times/K^\\times\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi,C_K,\\mathbb C^\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\n\\chi,C_K,\\tau_{C_K},\\mathbb C^\\times,\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in C_K\\;\\chi(xy)=\\chi(x)\\chi(y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in C_K\\;|\\chi(x)|=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tate\\text{-}thesis\\text{-}integral}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)\n\\to\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1\n\\to\nZ(f,\\chi,s)=\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\nf(x)\\chi(x)|x|_{\\mathbb A_K}^{s}\\,d^\\times x\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tate\\text{-}thesis}\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\n\\mathrm{UnitaryHeckeCharacter}_S(\n\\chi,K,\\tau_{C_K},\\tau_{\\mathbb C^\\times})\n\\land f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb A_K)\n\\to\\exists F,H\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(F,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(H,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1\n\\to F(s)=Z(f,\\chi,s)\\land H(s)=Z(\\widehat f,\\chi^{-1},s)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(F(s)=H(1-s)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr).","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"s=0","display":false},{"tex":"s=1","display":false}],"bytes":3601,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anc